      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "284811b4-97c8-489f-973d-c103a6c99e4c",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora compare:</p><ul><li><strong>el hospital</strong></li><li><strong>la oficina</strong></li></ul><p>Nos dois casos, há <strong>um lugar</strong>. O artigo muda com o nome: <strong>el</strong> com <strong>hospital</strong> e <strong>la</strong> com <strong>oficina</strong>.</p>",
